# Never upload these to Vercel.
#
# .data/ holds the demo booking store. Without this line the local demo file
# (including any test bookings typed during QA) is bundled into the deployment
# as /var/task/.data/demo-db.json — meaning invented data ends up live.
# Local scratch, research artefacts (raw photos, the reference clone) and the
# test suite are not needed to build or run the site.
.data/
.research/
tests/
coverage/
*.log

# Vercel/Next build output and dependencies are handled by the platform.
.next/
node_modules/
.vercel/
